   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "**abbia / sia** (present subjunctive of «avere» or «essere») + past participle: **abbia capito** (has understood), **sia venuto** (has come).",
      "With **essere**, the participle agrees: **sia venuta** (has come, she)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common expressions",
     "texto": [
      "With doubt, wish or evaluation, the subjunctive is normally preferred: **Non credo che sia venuto**, **È possibile che abbia capito**. With some verbs, including **credere**, the indicative can also appear when the content is presented as a certainty or in certain registers.",
      "Learn the usual pattern and pay attention to meaning and register."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
